ed Leather Vest in Black","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather. The leather is 1.2 mm thick.\nThick yet soft cowhide leather.\nThe base color of the leather is black.\nThe vest was braided around the edges with black cords.\n3 chrome-plated buckles (carabiners) as closures\nThree adjustable straps (buckles) per side\nEach strap has 5 holes for adjustment.\nThis way the vest also fits over the jacket.\nFive outer pockets (3 with zippers, 2 chest pockets with snap fasteners)\nTwo inside pockets, one of which has a zipper.\nThe lining is made of cotton.\nPlease refer to the size chart.\nSince this is a fitted women's vest (SLIM)","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9078-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9078-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9078-3.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9215","slug":"women-s-lamb-nappa-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9215","name":"Women's Lamb Nappa Leather Vest","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Genuine lamb nappa leather\r\nBlack base color\r\nSoft leather\r\nLeather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\n2 outer pockets\r\n2 inside pockets\r\nLeather drawstring at the waist for adjustment\r\nBraided leather band as a border\r\n3 buckle carabiners as closure\r\nAthletic fit (slim fit)","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9215-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9215-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9215-3.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9056","slug":"fitted-women-s-leather-vest-with-zipper-pcp-lv-9056","name":"Fitted women's leather vest with zipper","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust and soft lambskin leather\r\nThe vest is black\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\r\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be maintained with everyday care products such as leather milk, leather cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe vest can be expanded by up to 5cm on both sides, so you can also wear the vest over a jacket.\r\nThey have a zipper as a closure.\r\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\r\nTailored women's cut (so that the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9056-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9056-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9056-3.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-9144","slug":"lightweight-women-s-leather-vest-with-snap-fasteners-pcp-lj-9144","name":"Lightweight women's leather vest with snap fasteners","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust and soft lambskin leather\r\nThe vest is black\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\r\nVery easy to care for; use leather care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc.\r\nThe leather remains supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe vest can be expanded by up to 5cm on both sides, so you can wear the vest over a jacket.\r\nThey have 4 buttons as a closure.\r\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one with a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so that the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9144-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9144-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9144-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9144-4.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9017","slug":"tailored-women-s-leather-vest-made-of-soft-lambskin-leather-pcp-lv-9017","name":"Tailored women's leather vest made of soft lambskin leather","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, soft lambskin nappa leather\r\nThe vest is black\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\r\nVery simple and easy to care for\r\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket\r\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure\r\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9017-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9126","slug":"women-s-leather-vest-in-nubuck-brown-pcp-lv-9126","name":"Women's Leather Vest in Nubuck Brown","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Genuine nubuck cowhide\r\nThe leather has a brown base color\r\nThe surface has been finished with a slightly vintage look\r\nThe leather is 1.1 to 1.2 mm thick\r\nThe vest is braided with a brown leather strap around the waist\r\nAll rivets are firmly riveted through the leather\r\n3 chrome-plated buckles as closures\r\nExpandable by 5 cm on both sides\r\nThe vest has 2 outside pockets\r\nAnd 2 inside pockets, one with a zipper\r\nPlease refer to the size chart\r\nTailored women's cut\r\nSlim fit\r\nPlenty of room for a patch (no annoying seam on the back)","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9126-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9062","slug":"women-s-leather-vest-made-of-soft-lambskin-leather-with-buckles-pcp-lv-9062","name":"Women's Leather Vest Made of Soft Lambskin Leather with Buckles","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, durable, and soft lambskin leather\r\nThe vest is black\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\r\nVery easy to care for and maintain with daily care products such as nourishing milk, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, allowing you to wear it over a jacket\r\nIt has three chrome buckles for closure\r\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one with a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9062-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-994","slug":"women-s-nubuck-buffalo-leather-vest-pcp-lv-994","name":"Women's Nubuck Buffalo Leather Vest","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust nubuck buffalo leather with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\r\nThe vest is black.\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\r\nThe vest fastens with buckles.\r\nTwo outside pockets, two inside pockets.\r\nThe lining is made of polyester.\r\nLaced at the sides.\r\nTailored women's cut (slim fit).","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-994-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-907","slug":"women-s-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-907","name":"Women's Biker Leather Vest","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe vest is black and features black leather cords\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\r\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, allowing you to wear it over a jacket\r\nIt features three chrome-plated buckles for closure\r\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-907-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9061","slug":"women-s-leather-vest-tailored-fit-with-zipper-pcp-lv-9061","name":"Women's Leather Vest, Tailored Fit with Zipper","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Very soft lambskin nappa leather\r\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 mm\r\nThe base color of the leather is black\r\n3 adjustable hook-and-loop fasteners on each side\r\nThis allows you to adjust the vest perfectly\r\nCare instructions: You can condition the leather with leather balm\r\nTwo outer pockets with zippers\r\nTwo inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\r\nVery tailored women's cut\r\nPlease order 1/2 size larger\r\nPlease refer to the size chart included in the images","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9061-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-930","slug":"women-s-genuine-cowhide-leather-vest-pcp-lv-930","name":"Women's Genuine Cowhide Leather Vest","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe vest is black and finished with black leather cord\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\r\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe vest is fastened on both sides\r\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as closures\r\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-930-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9214","slug":"women-s-lambskin-nappa-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9214","name":"Women's Lambskin Nappa Leather Vest","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Genuine Lambskin Nappa Leather\r\nBlack base color\r\nSoft leather\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\n2 outside pockets\r\n2 inside pockets\r\nLeather cord at the waist for adjustment\r\nBraided leather trim\r\nZipper closure\r\nSporty fit (slim fit)","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9214-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9077","slug":"buckled-women-s-leather-vest-with-brown-accents-in-black-pcp-lv-9077","name":"Buckled women's leather vest with brown accents in black","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Extends up to 5 cm on each side\r\nA piece of leather is placed under the lacing\r\nThe two buckles are ideal for adjusting the waist (6 levels)\r\nThe vest is made of genuine cowhide (nappa leather / thick yet soft)\r\nThe leather thickness is 1.2 mm\r\nThe base color of the leather is brown\r\nThe surface has been dyed black (creating a slightly retro look)\r\n3 brass snap hooks as closures\r\nAll buckles are the same color\r\nThe vest has been finished with a braided leather border\r\n2 outer pockets (with zippers)\r\n2 inner pockets (one with zipper)\r\nTailored women's cut\r\nPlease refer to the size chart","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9077-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9219","slug":"women-s-biker-leather-vest-clubstyle-perforated-pcp-lv-9219","name":"Women's Biker Leather Vest Clubstyle Perforated","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\r\nLeather thickness from 1.0 to 1.1 mm\r\nThe base color of the leather is black\r\nThe upper part is quilted with a check pattern\r\nA polyester filling is sewn under the quilted pattern to make the pattern more visible\r\nThe lower part is made of perforated cowhide\r\n2 outer pockets with hidden snap fasteners\r\n2 inner pockets (one with a zipper)\r\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly deeper\r\nTo accommodate the patches on the front\r\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\r\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\r\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\r\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding\r\nTailored women's cut, slim fit","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9219-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9125","slug":"women-s-buckled-leather-vest-in-brown-pcp-lv-9125","name":"Women's Buckled Leather Vest in Brown","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide leather\r\nwith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\n2 outside pockets\r\n2 inside pockets\r\nExtends by 5 cm on each side (with lacing)\r\nAdjustable with straps on the sides\r\nBuckles on the shoulders are also available for adjustment","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9125-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-934","slug":"women-s-leather-vest-with-rivets-closed-on-the-sides-pcp-lv-934","name":"Women's Leather Vest with Rivets, Closed on the Sides","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe vest is black and has been finished with black leather cords\r\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be maintained with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather stays supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe vest is closed on both sides\r\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as closures\r\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\r\nVery eye-catching detailing with rivets and conchos on the front and back","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-934-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-993","slug":"women-s-leather-vest-with-rivets-and-side-laces-pcp-lv-993","name":"Women's Leather Vest with Rivets and Side Laces","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\r\nThe vest is black.\r\nEquipped with conchos and rivets.\r\nTailored women's cut (slim fit).\r\nThe vest fastens with buckles.\r\nTwo outside pockets, two inside pockets.\r\nThe lining is made of polyester.\r\nLaced at the sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-993-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9047","slug":"women-s-leather-vest-with-eagle-embosser-pcp-lv-9047","name":"Women's Leather Vest with Eagle Embosser","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nThick leather with a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThick yet soft cowhide leather\r\nThe vest is black\r\nThe eagle embossing is brown\r\nThe biker vest is finished with leather cords\r\n2 outside pockets\r\n2 inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\r\nExpandable up to 5 cm on both sides","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9047-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9013","slug":"women-s-biker-leather-vest-with-laser-print-pcp-lv-9013","name":"Women's Biker Leather Vest with Laser Print","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, sturdy cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe vest is dark brown and finished with leather cord\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\r\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket\r\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure\r\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\r\nLaser print on the back","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9013-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9076","slug":"buckled-leather-vest-in-black-with-brown-accents-pcp-lv-9076","name":"Buckled Leather Vest in Black with Brown Accents","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Women's Buckled Leather Vest\r\nGenuine cowhide with a thickness of 1.2 mm\r\nThe leather is black and has been treated with a lightly distressed finish\r\nThe lining is made of polyester\r\nTwo inside pockets\r\nThree outside pockets\r\nAdjustable buckles/straps on the sides\r\nAdjustable buckles/straps on the shoulders\r\n3 brass buckles for closure\r\nTailored women's cut (slim fit)\r\nIdeal for patches\r\nPlease refer to the size chart","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9076-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9021","slug":"women-s-biker-leather-vest-with-red-white-cords-pcp-lv-9021","name":"Women's Biker Leather Vest with Red/White Cords","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, sturdy cowhide\r\nThe vest is black and features white/red leather cords\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\r\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, allowing you to wear it over a jacket\r\nIt features three chrome-plated buckles for closure\r\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","